 "_comment": "R2881 sub7 ENDING narration — PER-SPRITE-RECT model (v204). Replaces the v94 band/window model (r2881_ending.json), whose inferred column windows did not match the game's real sprite table and lost ~10-13% of EN ink. Authority = R2881 sub6 sprite table (FILE 1967856, 123 x 28B records @+0x17a4: texset,nclut,x,y,u,v,w,h). Every text line is ONE rect (h=24) sampled from its page and drawn screen-centered (x=-w/2) except the img10 pair rows. 'seq' = first sprite index using the rect (= display order). texset 0 -> img0, 1-3 -> img1, 6-9 -> img10. The 16px punctuation sprites (、。) are blanked; EN carries its own punctuation. 'clip' (optional) narrows the drawable span to the intersection of rects that share pixels (img10 rect 62 [u8..176] vs 114 [u16..176]). 'align' default center. EN translated fresh from the JP in DISPLAY order (the old page-order EN merged unrelated passages).",
